1
00:00:00,887 --> 00:00:02,057
(Bernadette:)Thanks again for cooking.

2
00:00:02,222 --> 00:00:03,562
(Amy:)Yeah, everything was delicious.

3
00:00:03,723 --> 00:00:07,633
(Raj:)Well, I couldn't have done it
without my two favourite girls.

4
00:00:07,794 --> 00:00:10,464
(Raj:)Martha Stewart and Rachael Ray.

5
00:00:14,267 --> 00:00:16,767
(Mike:)Hey, Sheldon,
what do you say we go outside

6
00:00:16,937 --> 00:00:18,977
(Mike:)and throw around the old pigskin?

7
00:00:19,873 --> 00:00:21,253
(Sheldon:)This is a Jewish house.

8
00:00:21,408 --> 00:00:23,618
(Sheldon:)I don't think they have pigskin.

9
00:00:25,812 --> 00:00:28,222
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Did someone say pigskin?

10
00:00:30,250 --> 00:00:32,320
(Penny:)Hey, I'm sorry about today.

11
00:00:32,485 --> 00:00:34,465
(Penny:)And I promise,
next time I get married,

12
00:00:34,621 --> 00:00:35,761
(Penny:)it won't be a joke.

13
00:00:35,822 --> 00:00:37,632
(Penny:)It'll be for love.

14
00:00:37,791 --> 00:00:39,431
(Penny:)Or money.

15
00:00:42,896 --> 00:00:44,066
(Leonard:)I'm sorry, too.

16
00:00:44,231 --> 00:00:46,011
(Bernadette:)Don't be.
It's my fault.

17
00:00:46,166 --> 00:00:47,646
(Zack:)I was a terrible husband.

18
00:00:49,269 --> 00:00:51,479
(Zack:)I was never around.

19
00:00:53,740 --> 00:00:55,620
(Mike:)I know I'm hard on you,

20
00:00:55,775 --> 00:00:58,415
(Mike:)but you're not the worst
son-in-law in the world.

21
00:00:58,578 --> 00:01:01,318
(Howard:)Mike, that's the nicest thing
you've ever said to me.

22
00:01:01,481 --> 00:01:04,021
(Mike:)Well, I'm drunk.

23
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:09,800
(Sheldon:)I just vomited on a lot of clowns.

